'''Walk of Fame''' (ハリーウッド帝国 ''Hariuddo Teikoku'', '''Hollywood Empire''') is the 37th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Quite easy compared to the following sub-chapters with the possible exceptions of [[Beverly Hills Scoop]], [[Lovechild Lane]] and [[Saucy Scandals]].
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces "animated" enemy bases that can attack the player's cats, not unlike the player's [[Cat Cannon]]. The first animated enemy base, which is unofficially known as the [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]], is introduced in the final stage.

This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Inumusha]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy with exceptional health, along with massive damage and range. However, he has 50 knockbacks, one of the highest knockback counts in the game. Also, unlike most other Zombies, Inumusha cannot burrow, and he only revives with 25% HP instead of 50%.
This sub-chapter also includes a new obtainable character, [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Miyamoku Musashi]], who can be unlocked upon completion of the final stage, having a 30% drop chance (100% if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used).

